  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Update Creator Guidelines to add a section to regulate thumbnails (whether for Worlds or Avatars), to the effect of:\n\n`Thumbnails and other types of representative imagery should not misrepresent the actual World or Avatar. It is permissible to use stylistic or manipulated images or graphics, but such an image should not mislead anyone into acquiring a false or heavily altered impression of the actual World or Avatar it represents.`\n\n2. Promote the update and clarify VRChat's stance. You do not have to mention AI at all, just discourage the false imagery.\n\nUse common sense. Generally principles of false advertising should apply. Stop the epidemic of false content before it destroys the platform.",
